---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Academic | Diego Carrillo"
  description="University education in robotics, automation and electronic engineering, complemented by professional studies in networking, cybersecurity, software practices and artificial intelligence."
>
  <section class="min-h-[calc(100svh-5rem)] bg-black px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
    <nav aria-label="Academic navigation" class="academic-navigation">
      <a href="/#about" class="interactive-control academic-back-control" aria-label="Back to about" title="Back to about">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M20 12H4" />
          <path d="m10 6-6 6 6 6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <article class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-5xl pb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-violet-300">ACADEMIC</p>
      <h1 class="interactive-heading mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 sm:text-6xl">
        Built on electronics, robotics and control.
      </h1>

      <section class="academic-section mt-16" aria-labelledby="university-education">
        <p class="section-label" id="university-education">ACADEMIC BACKGROUND</p>

        <div class="academic-copy mt-8">
          <p>
            I completed the University Master's Degree in Robotics and Automation at Universidad Carlos III de Madrid, a Spanish public university, specialising in robotics, automation and intelligent systems. The qualification includes the official European Diploma Supplement (SET), providing a standardised record of its academic scope, competencies and level within the European education framework.
          </p>

          <p>
            I previously completed my Electronic Engineering degree in 2018, establishing a broad foundation in electronics, control, automation and communications. Together, both programmes combined theory with extensive practical work and shaped my systems-oriented approach to engineering.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="academic-section mt-20" aria-labelledby="professional-studies">
        <p class="section-label" id="professional-studies">ADDITIONAL STUDIES</p>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
          These studies complement my background in AI, networking, cybersecurity and software delivery.
        </p>

        <div class="learning-list mt-10">
          <article class="learning-item neon-box-panel">
            <h2>AI Neural Networks and Deep Learning</h2>
            <p>
              Foundational study of neural networks, deep-learning architectures and their application to data-driven engineering and intelligent systems.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="learning-item neon-box-panel">
            <h2>Cisco CCNA / IT Networking</h2>
            <p>
              Practical networking studies covering switching, routing, IP services, access control, security fundamentals and network automation.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="learning-item neon-box-panel">
            <h2>Managing Network Security</h2>
            <p>
              Study of network threats, security controls and risk-aware practices for protecting connected systems and information flows.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="learning-item neon-box-panel">
            <h2>Software Processes and Agile Practices</h2>
            <p>
              Study of iterative delivery, collaborative development, planning and continuous improvement for reliable software products.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .academic-navigation { width: fit-content; }

  .academic-back-control {
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.42);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgb(203 213 225);
    display: inline-flex;
    height: 2.65rem;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.65rem;
  }

  .academic-back-control svg { height: 1.7rem; width: 1.7rem; }

  .interactive-control.academic-back-control:hover {
    animation: nav-link-presence 520ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    background: transparent;
    border-color: rgb(196 181 253);
    box-shadow: none;
    color: rgb(196 181 253);
    transform: none;
  }

  .academic-section {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.16);
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    color: rgb(196 181 253);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  .academic-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .academic-copy p,
  .learning-item p:last-child {
    color: rgb(148 163 184);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .learning-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .learning-item {
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .learning-item h2 {
    color: rgb(203 213 225);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .learning-item p:last-child {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48.001rem) {
    .learning-item p:last-child {
      display: -webkit-box;
      overflow: hidden;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    }
  }

</style>
